  "historyNote": "#6916, eff 12-22-98; ss by #8303, EXEMPT, eff 4-1-05; ss by #8528, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-06; amd by #9468, EXEMPT, eff 5-12-09; ss by #10460, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-14",
